D Libraian Card Catalog card printerD This program is used to print out cardsD Prints either large (5x8) or small cards (3x5)D Prints "Shelf List" (by=Id), Title reference (by=Title),D Author reference (by=Author), or Subject referenceD (by=Subject).  By default a "Shelf List" is printed.S R infile The name of the file to print records fromB O largep If true, print large cards, else print small cardsS O by Should be one of {Id, Title, Author, Subject} - selects card type.S O only selection expression 